  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nour Saudi Voluntary Project to Combat Blindness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Performing specialized surgeries. Providing patients&apos; needs for medicines, glasses, and lenses as needed. Eliminating the suffering of many people with blindness. Health education for everyone receiving treatment for prevention. Supporting the Ministry of Health in the beneficiary country that suffers from a shortage of ophthalmologists</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing medical services in the field of combating blindness and the diseases that cause it to beneficiaries with limited income who cannot cover the costs of their treatment</narrative>
